nxremote builds on public research and prior art. No source code is copied from
the projects below except where stated.

* NXBT (https://github.com/Brikwerk/nxbt), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2021 Brikwerk.
  The SDP service record `src/nxremote/bt/sdp/switch-controller.xml` is taken
  from NXBT. The overall approach (BlueZ profile + raw L2CAP sockets, the
  subcommand handshake, reconnect heuristics) follows NXBT's findings;
  the implementation here is independent.
* dekuNukem/Nintendo_Switch_Reverse_Engineering
  (https://github.com/dekuNukem/Nintendo_Switch_Reverse_Engineering):
  report formats, SPI map and the HD rumble encoding tables.
* joycontrol (https://github.com/mart1nro/joycontrol) for earlier work on
  emulating controllers over Bluetooth.

